<title>ITALY: Magneti Marelli link with Labinal.</title>
<headline>Magneti Marelli link with Labinal.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian auto component maker Magneti Marelli, part of the Fiat group, said it and France's Labinal had agreed to study possible operating synergies and cooperation in their fields of activity in sensors and auto direction indicators.</p>
<p>Magneti gave no further details in its statement.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129589</p>
</text>
